{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12111240","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12111240","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1211124001:0":{"text":"这里确实是梦境，也是藏宝之地。从你们登上小岛的那一刻起，你们就进入了奥曼斯的梦中。","source_cn":"这里确实是梦境，也是藏宝之地。从你们登上小岛的那一刻起...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF8CC6964D297533","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1211124002:0":{"text":"奥曼斯……不是那棵树吗？","source_cn":"奥曼斯……不是那棵树吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51D19AA8FC8FB6A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1211124003:0":{"text":"哎呀，真可爱！你的记性真好。","source_cn":"哎呀，真可爱！你的记性真好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66154FBE54395BBB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1211124004:0":{"text":"那么，让我重新做个自我介绍吧。我是这里的保卫者，<style=\"highlight\">梦守妖精</style>——塔西。","source_cn":"那么，让我重新做个自我介绍吧。我是这里的保卫者，<st...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81868C628A1BD2AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1211124005:0":{"text":"奉特勒米琉斯的嘱托，我和奥曼斯在此地守护着风浪与漂泊之神藏在梦境里的宝藏。","source_cn":"奉特勒米琉斯的嘱托，我和奥曼斯在此地守护着风浪与漂泊之...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB98A0C209A03D05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","documen